  "cmd_name": "refresh-advisor-check",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Refreshes diagnostic items, triggers resource metric synchronization for the inspection items, and re-runs the inspection. This API creates inspection tasks based on multiple dimensions (cloud product, cloud resource, and diagnostic item name). If all dimensions are left empty, inspection tasks are created for all diagnostic items across all resources under the user by default",
  "description_zh": "刷新诊断项，触发该巡检项的资源指标同步并重新巡检。\n该API会按照输入的多个维度（云产品、云资源、诊断项名称）创建巡检任务，都为空则默认按照该用户下所有资源为所有诊断项创建巡检任务",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun advisor refresh-advisor-check --resource-id i-2zecnwitr2s7aca60000 --check-id EcsHighCpuUtilization --product ecs --biz-language zh --resource-dimension-list ProductName=example-string Product=example-string Reliablility=true Service=true Security=true Performance=true Cost=true --assume-aliyun-id 1 --check-plan-id 111 --token example-string --region cn-hangzhou",
